Array of Pointers
-----------------

The syntax for declaring array of pointers 

	syntax : 

		datatype *variable_name[no.of elements];

		int *p[3];
		
		p is an array of 3 pointers

		char *q[3];

		q is an array of 3 character pointers. 

		
int *p[3]; 

	what is the type of p ?
		
		p is an array of 3 int pointer

	what is the size of p ?
	
		3*8 = 24

	How many elements are present in p and what are those ?
		
		3. p[0], p[1], p[2]

	What is the type of p[0] ?
	
		int pointer

	What is the size of p[0] ?
		
		8 bytes

	
